Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd it reignite?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Something has to be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.94,0:00:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who reignited the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastardo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've messed with the wrong guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This soul does not belong to the chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey. Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single wound\Non him, but he's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You two have reignited\Nthe flame of salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,awaits repair as before you lie too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So he attacks anyone who sees\Nthe lighter being reignited!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This freak just came out of my shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be how he's\Ngonna rip out my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.34,0:02:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,When you shine, you will shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You will shine for your life.\NYou won't be able to shine. You
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Will continue to fight. You\Nwill be the people of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you live and become one\Nof the chosen? It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky's way stronger than golden wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The old man died after the\Narrow impaled his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll happen if he pierces my stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it your destiny to perish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If he drives that thing through\Nme, there's no way I'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I have no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really give a\Ndamn if Polpo is a capo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If that bloated bedroll\Nthinks he can derail my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and murder innocent bystanders\Nlike that nice old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,then he'll have to die by my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my Stan Golden Wind will\Nset your senses on fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,sending you into a slow-motion haze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.62,0:03:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:04:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But he should have zero\Nmotor control right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very most, he should\Nonly be able to crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind's ability won't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If he breaks free, I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He was hiding in the shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's definitely slower,\Nbut as powerful as before!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't move a muscle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,that's it he's been using the shadows he\Ncan move from shadow to shadow traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,at lightning speed but he shouldn't be\Nable to touch me here in the sunlight
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,still the sun will disappear behind\Nthe school in a matter of minutes once
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that happens i'm screwed but then again\NIf I can drag him into the sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,there might be something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.14,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worth a shot at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Question is, how do I draw him out? Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's waiting for you to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all he has to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait and watch the sunset\Nwith that creepy grin of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Koichi? Out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a dead man at\Nthe bottom of the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.26,0:06:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm innocent, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That stand right there attack, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me I'm wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.02,0:06:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I saw you, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.64,0:06:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You were talking to that old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I was watching the whole\Nthing from the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? So then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Koichi, did you see the lighter reignite?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't step into the handrail's shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, Koichi, you'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, he got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw the re-ignition of the\Nlighter before you light two paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you ever become one of the Chosen,\Nor is it your destiny to perish?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This arrow is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Interceptive Golden Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.10,0:06:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about searing Bane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt like all hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least now I'm able to give\Nyou a healthy dose of sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned the handrail\Ninto morning glories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for hiding in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There were more shadows nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can just pull him\Ninto the complete sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a chance at offing him for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that stand? Didn't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The murdering kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It killed the old man\Nafter he relit the lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We happened to see him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So now the damn thing has made\Ntargets out of the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's from the bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To think there'd be one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what in the world\Nhave you been getting into?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to make this arrow-wielding\Nstand come out of the woodwork?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take too long to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And really, you know as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me everything, and don't leave\Nout the stuff about the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you save me just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know more about the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is setting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me why you saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for one second I would\Never feel indebted to some thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The lighter was ignited\Nbecause of my careless actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The old man just got\Ncaught up in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole thing makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in what I set out to do, but\Nthat doesn't make it hurt any less.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible, but I can't stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a dream burning in my heart, and\NI'm seeing it through no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years back, I was\Nwounded with a similar arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what awakened my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If the power doesn't awaken,\Nthe victim is killed instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Awaken the ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:09:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The chosen are those whose\Nstands have awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be what Polpo is testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about the arrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have no idea where it came from,\Nbut I've faced this kind of stand before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's self-piloting in\Nlong range. It's deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, it's limited\Nto just simple attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but it won't give up until\Nit destroys its target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our best strategy is to find\Nthe user and take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I would like to, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.12,0:09:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's safely behind\Nbars, out of reach. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.48,0:09:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,he's stuck hiding in the\Nschool's shadow for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so we need to get to the side\Nfacing the sun while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, before the sun sets completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll lure him into the\Nshadow of some moving object
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,before ripping it away\Nwhen he least expects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll get totally whammied and\Nnot even know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.10,0:10:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You witnessed the re-ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The crows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He snuck out of the school's shadow\Nand hit in the shadow of the crows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This bastardo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Merida!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's faster and stronger when\Nhe's surrounded by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, act three, three, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My Reverb Act Three can weigh down stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It can do the same to\Nordinary objects, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The target's hands have been subdued.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider him super glued to\Nthe ground, Master Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.48,0:10:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't be able to hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I applied pressure to every\Ncentimeter of his hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This force should make bending\Nhis fingers impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but this\Nbastardo's not gonna let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Once more, before you lie to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When a stance suffers damage, the\Nsame injuries are felt by the user!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's going\Nto shatter Giorno's bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Act three, release three freezes now! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer that you didn't, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about\Nreleasing your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going, Mr. Tourist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have done me a bigger favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.68,0:11:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna crush your legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.22,0:11:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Wind can continuously inject\Nlife force into any organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I accelerated its growth to progress\Nthrough its entire life cycle,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and now it's withering away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:11:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But the tree's ten meters away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You dug a hole and struck the roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.32,0:12:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow's totally gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We dragged that creeper\Nright into the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You were rattling on\Nabout my having two paths,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's only one path\Nthat's lying in wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother, Koichi, but could I\Nask you to step to the right for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now bask in that southern Italian sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, just one path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the ride, stronzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wonder, was that enough\Nto get me into the Familia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Its existence in Italy\Nonly means that more
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,innocent people are going\Nto end up being killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to let Jotaro know everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.70,0:13:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing? You.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned there were more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed Polpo's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't be more wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit things would have been a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,worse if you hadn't\Ntaken care of that stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't let yourself be fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:14:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun only stopped the\Nstand from attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever he is, the user's perfectly fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's alive? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Most definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Long-range stands like we just fought\Nhave almost no effect on their users.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably has no idea that this\Nfight even took place. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's completely oblivious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he knows I'm a stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If he felt anything, it was maybe just\Nan unusual heaviness in his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But there'd be no way\Nthat he could learn that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you and I are stand users\Njust from that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,hey i'd really appreciate it if\Nyou'd move your hand now sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's a call i just can't\Nallow you to make it's not one guy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it's an organization a big one\Nif you call in backup word could
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,get out to the enemy enemy organization
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,this stays between us koichi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.84,0:15:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to dig into\Nthis luscious donation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to recall where we left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you again, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, you're a Giorno, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My mind is always going elsewhere\Nwhen I'm having a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All the blood goes to the stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may be so bold, Giorno,\Nare you a man of God?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not devout,\Nif that's what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be for the best,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.78,0:16:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,for what I'm about to say to you\Nruns counter to the word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I ask that you take our chat to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If having faith in one's\Nfellow man is paramount,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.90,0:16:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,then it must also be true\Nthat there's no greater
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,offense to a fellow man\Nthan the act of disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Abusing that trust is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only does the act dishonor the\Nbenefactor of that fragile trust,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but it also jeopardizes his\Nvery life and livelihood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Money and profit mustn't\Ncloud your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you've lost a\Nseat at the theater or even a bus stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't engage in actions\Nthat'll risk one's own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Conflict's a sport for barbarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pastime for fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I or any of my men are\Ndisrespected, all bets are off, Pivello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In the eyes of God, murder is acceptable\Nwhen one has been disrespected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd commit that to memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Bravissimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a member of the Familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me when I say I had every confidence\Nyou'd return the light or a flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the badge of\Nthe Passione Syndicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's proof that you succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.02,0:17:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For the time being, you shall be\Nreceiving your orders from Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.70,0:18:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This calls for a toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that mochoso really pull off\Nkeeping the lighter on for 24 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,or did he reignite the flame and get
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,reborn as a stand user oh well who the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,hell cares it's always so easy to pull\Nthe strings of the young and confused
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever he is I'm positive\Nhe will serve us well
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.35,0:18:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I closed that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be all my blood\Nrushing to my stomach again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So you met again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, Jotaro, but\NI've been thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy, Giorno Giovanna,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,he doesn't pose the kind of\Nthreat you were worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, let's discuss it in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want,\Nthen that's what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll talk soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.00,0:19:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.91,0:19:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, in the beginning\NI wasn't sure about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd guess I'd be lying\Nif I said I didn't think
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno was insane for having\Nsuch lofty aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, I feel it in my bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.10,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He truly has a heart of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched three generations of Joestars\Nfight for good all the way back in Morioh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was as if their righteous\Nhearts became their life energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.86,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,their motive to carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I witnessed the same fire in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.94,0:20:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt the blood\Ncoursing through his
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,veins holds the determination\Nof the Joestars.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why it's only right I honor his\Nwish and keep his secret in confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He deserves that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise to protect that golden\Ndream with everything I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kay, I'm long overdue\Nfor some sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's odd. What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,oh well so an act of disrespect is
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.82,0:21:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,justification for murder in your book huh\Ni see now you taught me a very important
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,lesson which is handy since you\Ndisrespected the life of that innocent old
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,took the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,liberty of changing one
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,of your guns into your favorite snack
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your last meal,\NPopo. Hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to meet my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.74,0:22:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see, I would give
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.56,0:22:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,anything Just to make\Nyou understand me I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.28,0:22:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,give a damn about\Nnothing else Freaking you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,is all I need I need
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To blame. I need to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to blame
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby tonight you won't be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.60,0:23:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to do. What must\NI say? Tell me what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.48,0:23:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Must I do what must I\Ndo to show how much? Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.28,0:23:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a freak at you, Baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, you're stuck to me.\NWhat you must not do? Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a freak at you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
